  "longBusinessSummary": "Quálitas Controladora, S.A.B. de C.V., through its subsidiaries, provides insurance, coinsurance, and reinsurance services in the accidents and illnesses, damages, health, and automobile areas in Mexico, the United States, El Salvador, Peru, and Costa Rica. The company offers personal cars and pickups, cargo pickups, trucks, public passenger service, border and regularized, tourists, motorcycles, and standardized basic insurance products, as well as professional liability insurance for insurance agents. It also provides foreign liability and compulsory vehicle civil liability insurance products. In addition, the company is involved in acquisition and rental of real estate; acquisition, sale, and service of automotive glass, auto parts, and automotive spare parts; manufacturing of telemetry-oriented hardware for heavy and light equipment fleets; offers internet of things ecosystem and cloud ecosystem; and provision of administrative, salvage management and marketing, and data analysis, as well as advice, consulting, and training services in the areas of investment planning and business administration. Quálitas Controladora, S.A.B. de C.V. founded in 1993 and is based in Mexico City, Mexico.",
